<Layout title="Contact us" description="Reach the StudentOffers project with a question, research correction, or suggestion through its GitHub repository."><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About', href: '/about/' },{ label: 'Contact Us' }]} /><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h1>Keep the conversation useful.</h1><p>Questions, corrections, and ideas for StudentOffers can be shared through the project repository.</p></header><article class="prose"><h2>Contact the project</h2><p>Use the repository’s issue tracker for public questions and suggestions. For a listing correction, include the offer page and an official source that supports the change.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/demidmorozov/studentoffers/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the issue tracker <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><h2>Questions about an offer?</h2><p>For applications, eligibility checks, billing, or account questions, contact the provider using the official source on the offer’s detail page. StudentOffers provides information and does not process applications.</p></article></div></Layout>
